            <div xml:id="d563">

                <pb facs="0620" n="608" sameAs="frus:frus1941v02/pg608"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.91262/245b: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Germany</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Morris</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-04-26T15:00:00-05:00">April 26, 1941—3
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1197. With such references as you may deem appropriate to either oral or written
                    communications on the Hottelet case, please address a note to the German Foreign
                    Office indicating the concern of this Government at his continued detention and
                    inquiring when information may be expected as to the charges against him and
                    when it is anticipated that the preliminary investigation will be completed.
                    Request also permission to have a consul visit him in prison from time to
                    time.</p>
                <p>Please confirm whether counsel has been obtained.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
